{
  "_comment": "阿贵对话树。主犯。初始伪装悲痛，被质问后逐渐露出马脚。",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "（阿贵蹲在墙角，眼睛红肿）大人……小的、小的实在是太害怕了……那一晚上的事，小的到现在还没缓过来……",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "问问当晚发生了什么",
          "goto": "intro",
          "type": "ask"
        },
        {
          "text": "你和周德茂关系怎样？",
          "goto": "ask_relationship",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_talked_once"
            }
          ],
          "type": "press"
        },
        {
          "text": "你是怎么从水里活下来的？",
          "goto": "press_alibi",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_talked_once"
            }
          ],
          "type": "press"
        },
        {
          "text": "【出示遣散字据】这是什么？",
          "goto": "show_dismissal",
          "requires": [
            {
              "evidence": "evidence_dismissal_note"
            }
          ],
          "type": "evidence"
        },
        {
          "text": "【出示浮囊】这东西从你包袱里翻出来的",
          "goto": "show_bladder",
          "requires": [
            {
              "evidence": "evidence_float_bladder"
            }
          ],
          "type": "evidence"
        },
        {
          "text": "（对峙）证据够了。说实话吧。",
          "goto": "confession",
          "requires": {
            "all": [
              {
                "evidence": "evidence_hull_hole"
              },
              {
                "evidence": "evidence_float_bladder"
              },
              {
                "any": [
                  {
                    "evidence": "evidence_dismissal_note"
                  },
                  {
                    "evidence": "evidence_gambling_iou"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "type": "confrontation"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "intro": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "那天……那天夜里，老爷说要赶路，非坐夜船不可。小的劝了，老爷不听。",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "到了江心，突然船就晃得厉害——然后水就涌进来了！什么都看不见，什么都抓不住！",
          "emotion": "panic",
          "highlight": [
            "水涌进来"
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "小的只记得呛了好多水……等醒过来的时候已经在岸上了。（哽咽）老爷他……老爷他不在了……",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "text": "哭得倒凶，可他说得太空了。",
          "emotion": "thinking"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "空话多，细节少。继续问。",
          "emotion": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ],
      "set_flags": [
        "agui_talked_once"
      ]
    },
    "ask_relationship": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "老爷对小的很好。十二年了，吃住都是老爷供的。",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "小的这辈子都感激老爷的大恩。",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_alibi": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "小的……小的也不知道。命大吧。抱着一块船板就飘上来了。",
          "emotion": "defensive",
          "highlight": [
            "抱着一块船板"
          ],
          "record_type": "testimony",
          "record_title": "证词记录：阿贵的生还说法",
          "record_text": "阿贵声称自己抱着一块船板漂上岸。"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "text": "冬天的江水，不会游泳的人抱块板子就能活？",
          "emotion": "thinking"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "先记下。他的说法站不稳。",
          "emotion": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "show_dismissal": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "！……那、那是……",
          "emotion": "panic"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "老爷他……他是说过要把小的遣散。但小的没有怨恨！真的没有！",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "二两银子……十二年……",
          "emotion": "shaken"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "（声音颤抖）小的没有怨恨。",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "text": "十二年只值二两——换了谁都咽不下这口气。",
          "emotion": "thinking"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "记下了。",
          "emotion": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ],
      "set_flags": [
        "agui_dismissal_confronted"
      ]
    },
    "show_bladder": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "（猛地站起来）那——那不是小的的！是、是……",
          "emotion": "panic"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "……",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "（沉默良久，蹲在地上发抖）",
          "emotion": "shaken"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "大人……小的真的什么都没做……请……请明察……",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "xia_lingyao",
          "text": "（冷笑）证据都翻出来了，嘴还这么硬。",
          "emotion": "thinking"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "不急。还有话要问你。",
          "emotion": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续询问",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ],
      "set_flags": [
        "agui_bladder_confronted"
      ]
    },
    "confession": {
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "阿贵。我不想再绕弯子了。",
          "emotion": "accusatory"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "浮囊、船底的洞、你那身衣服——所有证据都指向你。",
          "emotion": "piercing"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "agui",
          "text": "（猛然站起）大人！小的——小的是冤枉的！",
          "emotion": "panic"
        },
        {
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "text": "那好。一条一条过。你说的每一句话——我都有东西反驳。",
          "emotion": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "set_flags": [
        "confrontation_triggered"
      ],
      "trigger_confrontation": true,
      "options": []
    }
  }
}